@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "WenQuanYi Micro Hei"
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction

title LLM request 当前投影与展示路径

component "Transport / Assembly\nHTTP、WebSocket、payload 组装" as Assembly
component "Request Parser Registry\n请求类型匹配" as Registry
component "Request Projector\n生成 llm.request" as Projector
component "Canonical Blocks\n骨架、块引用与去重块" as Blocks
database "Storage\nmanifest、block refs、blocks" as Storage
component "Web View API\n重建 body_json" as Api
component "Browser LLM Insight\n解释 messages / input / tools" as Browser

Assembly --> Projector : 完整 request body
Projector --> Registry : JSON
Registry --> Projector : classifier / protocol / model
Projector --> Blocks : canonical JSON
Blocks --> Storage : retention policy 允许时写入
Storage --> Api : 只读查询
Api --> Browser : raw body_json

note bottom of Registry
  当前 parser 只返回识别元数据
  不返回统一的 request item 模型
end note

note bottom of Browser
  当前 wire-format 解释仍位于前端
end note
@enduml
